<view class="page">
  <view class="nav" style="padding-top:{{statusBarHeight}}px">
    <view class="back" bindtap="back">‹</view>
    <text>设置昵称</text>
    <view class="space"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="content">
    <view class="intro">
      <view class="nickname-mark">称</view>
      <view class="intro-copy">
        <text class="intro-title">设置你的昵称</text>
        <text class="intro-note">昵称用于首页问候及公共服务互动，不会替代实名认证姓名。</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <text class="label">昵称</text>
      <input class="nickname-input" type="nickname" maxlength="24" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="onNicknameInput" placeholder="请输入昵称" />
      <text class="field-hint">可以使用微信昵称快捷填写，也可以手动输入；最多24个字符。</text>
      <button class="save-button" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存昵称</button>
    </view>

    <view class="privacy-note">
      <text class="note-mark">隐</text>
      <text>昵称由你主动填写，仅用于本平台提供个人化服务。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
